Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 17:56:33 -0600
Subject: [PATCH 1414/1463] HERESY 1461: the Refiner as the Engine and the
 Guide: its steps in a column at the left in three groups, the open step at
 the right, what is made under it
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Viktor 15.10.2026: «Если считаешь, что нужна переделка дизайна комнаты Огранщика, или несколько вкладок внутри, — одобряю». Wider than 1100 px the room is a grid: the head, the import and the chain across the top; the steps as tabs in a column at the left (the Engine's look), grouped in the chain's order: Hear and look (Spectrum, Artifacts, Lyrics), Mend (Debuzz, Upscale, Stems), Finish (Remaster, and a plugin's steps with a dashed edge); the open step at the right, as tall as it is, and what is made from the take right under it. Narrower, one column as before. A plugin's panels stand before the tree as the studio's own, its fields in a row of their own widths. Three new strings in all eleven catalogs. Kitchen suite 821/0 (one new check).

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
